        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kiyakiyarae Ŋikarebok Kanaan",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kirwor Ekapolon neni a Moses tema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kiyakiya ŋikilyok torebo akwap a Kanaan, akwap ŋina ainakini ayoŋ neni a Ŋisirael. Emaikina kiyakiya epeikile a ŋolokabila, torae daŋ ikes ŋikarikok alotuŋa kec.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai Moses kiyakiya ŋikarebok analoŋisat a ŋina a Paran, iwuapit ŋuna alimuni Ekapolon, arae ŋikilyok ŋul daadaŋ ŋikarikok alotuŋa a Isirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋirorwa kec ikes lu: Alokabila a Ruben kiyakiyarae Samua lokoku a Sacur, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alokabila a Simeon kiyakiyarae Sapat lokoku a Ori, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alokabila a Yuda kiyakiyarae Kaleb lokoku ka Yepune, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alokabila a Isakar kiyakiyarae Igal lokoku a Yosepu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alokabila a Epuraim kiyakiyarae Osea lokoku a Nun, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alokabila a Benjamin kiyakiyarae Paliti lokoku a Rapu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alokabila a Sebulon kiyakiyarae Gadiel lokoku a Sodi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alokabila a Manase ( iŋes ekabila a Yosepu), kiyakiyarae Gadi lokoku a Susi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alokabila a Dan kiyakiyarae Amiel lokoku a Gemali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alokabila ka Aser kiyakiyarae Sesur lokoku a Mikael, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alokabila a Naputali kiyakiyarae Nabi lokoku a Popisi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alokabila a Gad kiyakiyarae Geuel lokoku a Maki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erae ŋul ŋirorwa a ŋikilyok a ŋulu abu Moses kiyakiya akireb akwap a Kanaan, abu Moses kilocok ekiro ka Osea alokoku a Nun toruwor Yosua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Moses kiyakiya ŋikilyok ŋul akireb akwap a Kanaan, tolimok ikes tema, “Kitipeiyosi ama tooma Negeb, kitipeiyosi nakwap ŋina a ŋikamukumukui, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ido toanyut epite ŋolo eyakar akwap ŋin, toanyut kegogoŋ ŋituŋa ŋulu iboiyete a nen, kori kepalag, kelalak, kori kekudyoko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka toanyut erae kejok akwap ŋina iboiyoto ŋin, kori kerono, kewuatae a ŋarwatatain ŋitaunio ŋulu iboiyoto ŋituŋa ŋul, kori kemam ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka toanyut kejokak ŋalup a akwap a ŋin, kori keroko, keya ŋikito nakwap ŋin, kori kemam. Totitiny iyes, ido yaut ŋaraito ŋadi ŋuna ka akwap a ŋin.” Arae apaki ŋin apaki ŋina akokitotor ŋaraito ŋuna esyaunak ŋuna ke epiini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu nai ŋikilyok ŋul toloto torebo akwap ŋin ameun analoŋisat a Sin akitodol Reob diyete Leboamas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun apotu ikes kitipeiyosi Negeb, todolo Eburon, Aiman ka Sesai ta Talimai. Arae Ŋianaki ikes eboiyete a nen. (Kedukyo Eburon ŋikaru ŋikanikaarei eriŋa nyeduko Soan alo Ijipit.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Todolo ŋikilyok, ŋul tari nayonae Esikol, totubut a nen ateni apei ŋina ke ekitoe ke epiini eyai etunene ŋolo a ŋaraito ke epiini, kinenekis nakitoe, ido toryoŋa ŋikilyok ŋiarei, apotu daŋ ŋikilyok ŋul tolemut ŋaraito ŋuna enyaritae Pomegranate ta ŋaboboryo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyaritae akibois ŋin ayonae Esikol ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13:24",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Esikol",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Iŋes atemar etunene",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " aŋuna a etunene a ŋolo a ŋaraito ke epiini a ŋolo apotu Ŋisirael totubut a nen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋakiro ŋuna ayaunete ŋikarebok",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kelunyar ŋirwa ŋatomoniomwon, toboŋut ŋikarebok anakireb akwap a Kanaan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "potu ikes neni a Moses ka Aron ta neni ka atukot a Ŋisirael a ŋulu ayakasi apaki ŋin naloŋisat ŋina a Paran nakibois ŋina anyaritae Kades, yaut ŋikarebok ŋul ŋakiro kec neni a Moses ka Aron ta neni ka atukot a Ŋisirael, kitoodikis daŋ ŋikarebok Ŋisirael ŋuluce ŋaraito ka akwap a Kanaan, ŋuna ayaunete ikes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimokis ikes Moses temasi, “Adoli isua nakwap ŋina ikiyakiyarit iyoŋ isua; eleleete ŋakile ka a ao anakwap a ŋin, ŋaraito keŋ ikes nu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai egogoŋ nooi ŋituŋa ŋulu iboiyete anakwap a ŋin ka ewuatae a ŋarwatatain ŋitaunio kec, nabo nyedisyak ŋitaunio kec ka nabo eŋolikin isua ŋiletok ka Anak aina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋiamaleki ikes iboiyete anakwap a ŋina a Negeb; Ŋiitaiti, Ŋiyebusi ka Ŋiamori ikes iboiyete anakwap a ŋina a ŋikamukumukui, ido Ŋikanaani ikes iboiyete alodiyete anam ka alodiyete aŋolol Yorodan.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai kisililiŋ Kaleb ŋituŋa alokiŋaren Moses tema, “Oloto atipei ekamasi akwap ŋin toruwor ŋina yok, anerae ikipedori iwon akiloun ŋituŋa ŋul.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Temasi nai ŋikilyok ŋulu alosito ka iŋes akireb akwap ŋin, “Nyikipedori iwon akitijikin ŋituŋa ŋul, anerae egogoŋ ikes akilo iwon.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, apotu ikes tolimokis Ŋisirael ŋakiro ŋuna pa ajokak aŋuna ka akwap a ŋina alosito ikes akireb temasi, “Akwap daadaŋ ŋina arebi isua, erae akwap ŋina emunyanarotor ŋituŋa, nabo ŋituŋa ŋulu aponi isua kiŋolikinae anakwap a ŋin eburok nooi, mam ituŋanan isikwaanare anakwap a daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikiŋolik isua anakwap a ŋin Ŋinepilim (arae Ŋianaki ŋiletok a Ŋinepilim) ani ikisikwaanikin isua ka ikes, tosubunae isua ŋabeerei koŋin, aneni kec daŋ asibitae isua ŋabeerei koŋin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
